    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this 2d platformer you play as a polyamorous head that pushes his enemies away using the power of scream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your wives have been kidnapped and your life had been destroyed by none other than your own body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It's time to prove once and for all that mind rules over body and not the other way around!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This colorful gem of a gaming experience with unbelievably punchy soundtrack and infuriatingly pushy enemies is everything you need! <i>(if everything you need is a game about a head that is screaming)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Now go ahead and SCREAM YOUR HEAD OFF!!!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this 2d platformer you play as a polyamorous head that pushes his enemies away using the power of scream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your wives have been kidnapped and your life had been destroyed by none other than your own body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It's time to prove once and for all that mind rules over body and not the other way around!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This colorful gem of a gaming experience with unbelievably punchy soundtrack and infuriatingly pushy enemies is everything you need! <i>(if everything you need is a game about a head that is screaming)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Now go ahead and SCREAM YOUR HEAD OFF!!!</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Screaming Head is a psychedelic 2d platformer about a walking head that fights his enemies using the power of scream. It is darkly comedic, flips familiar gaming concepts on its head and features 90s-MTV-Liquid-Television-style animations and a punchy hip-hop-inspired soundtrack.",
